Bharadvāja gives daughter to ascetic Viśravas --- Viśravas begets Vaiśravaṇa praised by Brahmā --- Brahmā names Viśravas-like child Vaiśravaṇa --- Vaiśravaṇa performs millennia of water air fasting --- Brahmā grants fourth guardianship and wealth lordship --- Brahmā gives sunlike Puṣpaka vimāna --- Viśravas assigns Viṣṇu-emptied Viśvakarman-built Laṅkā --- Vaiśravaṇa settles Laṅkā and visits parents by Puṣpaka